---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ExtrasArtwork from '../../components/ExtrasArtwork.astro';
import { renewalQuestions } from '../../data/softwareRenewal';
import '../../styles/services.css';
import '../../styles/editorial-pages.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Software Renewal Checklist: Free PDF | Cloud & Capital" description="Eight questions about cost, usage, dependencies, and switching work before renewing software. Download the free checklist, with no signup required.">
<main id="main-content" class="offer-page editorial-page resource-page">
<section class="offer-shell editorial-hero"><div><p class="offer-eyebrow">Free worksheet · Eight questions</p><h1><span class="renewal-title-line">Before you renew</span><br/><em>that software.</em></h1><p class="editorial-lede">Your software has a renewal date. It deserves a little performance review.</p><p>Pick one subscription. Bring the bill and a recent example of how it is used.</p><div class="offer-actions"><a class="offer-button" href="/downloads/before-you-renew-that-software.pdf" download>Download the PDF →</a><a class="quiet-link" href="#questions">Read the questions ↓</a></div><p class="small-note">Two pages, with space for your answers. No signup required.</p></div><div class="editorial-hero-art"><ExtrasArtwork kind="renewal"/></div></section>
<section id="questions" class="offer-shell editorial-section"><p class="offer-eyebrow">Work through one decision</p><ol class="question-grid">{renewalQuestions.map(q=><li><h2>{q.title}</h2><p>{q.detail}</p></li>)}</ol></section>
<section class="offer-shell resource-next"><p class="offer-eyebrow">Then choose a next step</p><h2>Keep. Adjust. Compare.<br/><em>Or investigate a little further.</em></h2><p>Write down your reason, who will act, and when you’ll revisit the decision. A clear answer may be all you need.</p><p>Once you know the next step, keep the charge, renewal date and notice deadline together in the free Software Renewal Tracker. Compare monthly equivalents with the full payments due each month.</p><div class="offer-actions"><a class="offer-button" href="/tools/software-renewal-tracker" data-analytics-event="cta_click" data-analytics-destination="software_renewal_tracker" data-analytics-source="software_renewal_resource">Open the renewal tracker →</a><a class="quiet-link" href="/services#inquiry">Still tangled? Tell me the question →</a></div></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
